@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Privacy & Patient Data Stewardship";
}

<section class="legal-page-band">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="legal-card">
            <div class="editorial-kicker">Alexandria Coastal Sanctuary &bull; Confidentiality Charter</div>
            <h1 class="serif-display legal-title">Privacy &amp; Patient Data Stewardship</h1>
            <p class="legal-lead">
                At MANARA Medical Complex, patient confidentiality is foundational to compassionate care. Every consultation record, diagnostic panel, imaging report, and account notification is handled under strict role-based medical confidentiality.
            </p>

            <div class="legal-sections">
                <section class="legal-block">
                    <h2>1. Medical Confidentiality &amp; Access Controls</h2>
                    <p>
                        Clinical histories, laboratory panels, radiology PACS studies, and attending physician notes are accessible solely to authorized clinical staff directly involved in your care and to your verified patient account. Laboratory and diagnostic reports remain held until specialist verification and release are completed.
                    </p>
                </section>

                <section class="legal-block">
                    <h2>2. Information Collected for Care Continuity</h2>
                    <p>
                        To coordinate outpatient visits, returning follow-up discounts, prescriptions, and specialist consultation replies, MANARA stores patient demographic contact information, scheduled clinic slots, vitals, signed diagnoses, and notification delivery logs in our encrypted hospital database.
                    </p>
                </section>

                <section class="legal-block">
                    <h2>3. Notification &amp; Communication Preferences</h2>
                    <p>
                        Patients maintain direct control over automated laboratory, radiology, prescription, appointment, and doctor-reply alerts through <a asp-controller="Account" asp-action="Settings">Settings &amp; Preferences</a>. You may adjust accessibility preferences and email notification categories at any time.
                    </p>
                </section>

                <section class="legal-block">
                    <h2>4. Privacy Desk &amp; Data Inquiries</h2>
                    <p>
                        Questions regarding medical records access, profile verification, or correction of demographic details may be submitted via our <a asp-controller="Consult" asp-action="Index">Consult &amp; Feedback</a> desk or in person at MANARA Cornish Pavilion Reception in Alexandria.
                    </p>
                </section>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

